// 620 rows across 8 departments, 570 of them on the site (50 are delisted,
// AW-001). Edit here to add/remove products. The
// departments and their product lines are derived from the cat + sub fields
// below (departmentsFor in ../lib/departments.js) — no separate list to sync.
//
// Row fields:
//   variants     the sellable variants a buyer chooses between; one variant is
//                auto-selected, none means the product is sold as-is. Cards
//                count them (variantCount in ../lib/lines.js), and labels are
//                unique within a row
//   variantAxis  what the variants differ by, on every row with two or more:
//                Flavor, Size, Color, Style, Format, Strength, Type or Variety
//                (the noun the description counts them with; mixed lists are
//                Variety). The product page asks "Choose a flavor" and shows
//                the "flavors change often" note only for Flavor (AW-128)
//                TODO(owner): Rows in the restricted lines keep their wording (decision 2), so #265 Hard Steel and #332 Black Tiger Honey still call their formats "flavors" in the description. May they say "varieties" and "formats" once the legal review is done? (AW-128)
//   sellUnit     what quantity 1 means, only when the product's own name or
//                description states it (e.g. "5-pack", "25-count box",
//                "box of 200", "jar"); never guessed, and empty renders nothing
//                The owner and staff set the rest in Admin -> Products (one
//                product, or many with Set sell unit; owner answer 2026-10,
//                AW-031); npm run seed prints how many rows have none here.
//   img          photo filename in ../assets/products, or null while a photo is
//                still needed. Resolved to a responsive set by ../lib/images.js.
//   description  what the product is and how it is packed, in the maker's
//                voice (src/data/productCopy.js). Flavors, sizes and colors
//                stay on the variant list, not in this sentence.
//   sku          unique, stable code; quick reorder matches it exactly, and
//                variant codes append the variant slug (see ../lib/lines.js)
//
// There are no prices here, and none may be added (AW-003): this file ships to
// every visitor. List prices live only in Supabase (products.price), and
// approved buyers get their tier's prices from the my_prices() function
// (../lib/pricing.js). Rows added here reach an existing database through
// `npm run seed`, which only inserts new ids; a change to a row that is
// already in the database needs an UPDATE data migration (AW-032).
//
// A new row's id must be above the live database's
// `select max(id) from public.products`, not just above the ids in this file:
// Admin -> Products gives new products ids from the same sequence
// (products_id_seq). A row whose id staff already used is skipped by the
// seed (it raises a notice naming the id), and a new row with a SKU another
// product already has stops the seed with an error (NEW-022).
//
// Delisted (AW-001, owner answer 2026-10): every Kratom & Kava and Mushroom
// Products row is `active: false`, kept and never deleted, so order history,
// print sheets and old carts still name them (src/data/delisted.js). PRODUCTS
// below leaves them out, the seed writes them inactive, and
// supabase/migrations/20261014100000_delist_kratom_mushroom.sql deactivates
// them in a database that already has them. Rows added to those lines in
// stage 1 (./stage1Catalog.js) start inactive the same way.
//
// Stage 1 (November 2026): ./stage1Catalog.js adds the warehouse sheet's
// names that were not already a row. Photos are stage 2 (img is null) and
// prices and specifications are stage 3 (no price, no invented variants).
//
// TODO(owner): After legal review, which of Detox, Wellness Pills, and the
// Honey & Energy enhancement items should be delisted, de-featured, or kept?
// Do not change those lines until then. (AW-001)
//
